game (
	name "A Golden Wake"
	description "A Golden Wake is the first commercial adventure game released by Grundislav Games. Like the developer's previous free adventure games, A Golden Wake was created with a retro low resolution style using Adventure Game Studio. A real estate salesman named Alfie Banks seeks to make a fortune in America during the roaring 20's. He loses his job in New York and heads off to make his claim in the booming real estate market in Coral Gables, Florida. The game is based on actual events and features real life locations and historical features."
