game (
	name "Broken Sword: The Shadow of the Templars"
	description "George Stobbart is an American tourist on holiday in Paris in the autumn. The story opens with Georges quiet coffee at a cafe rudely interrupted by the explosion of a bomb planted by a man dressed up as a clown. He sets off investigating the explosion and, gradually, he and photo-journalist Nico Collard are drawn into a globe-trotting adventure involving conspiracies, cults and murder, all revolving around the Knights Templar."
