game (
	name "God of Thunder"
	description "The mighty god Odin goes from time into deep sleep. During the time of such an 'Odinsleep', the mischievous god Loki stole from Odin his favorite land, Midgard, and populated it by monsters. But Odin has a son - Thor, the god of thunder. Using his powerful hammer Mjolnir, Thor must travel to Midgard, face Loki and his assistants, and reclaim the land for his father."
