game (
	name "Gregory and the Hot Air Balloon"
	description "Gregory and the Hot Air Balloon is a children's adventure game (aimed at ages 4-7) that tells the story of Gregory Chuckwood - a young woodchuck who lives in a quiet and cozy town of Acorn Hollow. One sunny day Gregory and his pet lizard Newt go for a ride in a hot air balloon, which gets loose and crash lands near a carnival. Now the hero has to fix the balloon and to find the way back home - as well as to engage in different fun activities at the carnival."
