game (
	name "Grim Fandango"
	description "Grim Fandango takes place in the Land of the Dead, where recently departed souls make their way to the Ninth Underworld. For sinners, this is a four-year journey made on foot, and many do not complete it, being eaten, 'sprouted,' or ending up taking jobs at way-points along the route. However, more virtuous souls receive assistance, the most virtuous getting passage on the 'Number Nine' train ('Double N') that cuts the journey down to four minutes."
