	description "The premise here is that the university is haunted, however a professor believes there is a weapon that can free the university from it's curse. The catch is, the gem needed to power that weapon is hidden (of course) inside the haunted university. The art for this game is leagues abve most of the other world builder games. I'm not sure if it is original or 'borrowed', but it looks excellent."
