game (
	name "Heroine's Quest: The Herald of Ragnarok"
	description "Heroine's Quest: The Herald of Ragnarok is a tribute game to Sierra's classic Quest for Glory series. You play as a female adventurer, who was ambushed by trolls and woke up in the local Adventure Guild. Waking up, you sign the local logbook and learn that the local village is suffering from an unnatural winter, food is getting scarce and trolls more aggressive. Some say it is but a prelude to the end of the world - Ragnarok. The Frost Giants are looking for ways to free their leader, the devious trickster Loki, and then they will try to march against both man and gods. This place is in a desperate need of a hero. And congratulations, you just got the job. Good luck."
	releaseyear "2013"
	releasemonth "12"
	releaseday "24"
	developer "Crystal Shard"
	genre "Adventure / Point & Click / Role-Playing"
	users "1"
	publisher "Crystal Shard"
	code "heroinesquest"
