game (
	name "Living Books: The Cat in the Hat"
	description "The Cat in the Hat is an interactive storybook for children, created with the Mohawk Living Books player. The book is an interactive story based on the Dr. Seuss children's book of the same name. A cat in a hat transforms a dull, rainy afternoon into a magical adventure. As the story is read, the objects in the background are clickable."
