game (
	name "Magic Tales: Liam Finds a Story"
	description "Inspired by a centuries-old Irish folk tale, Liam Finds a Story is the tale of a young boy who must search far and wide for an original story in order to save his family from a gluttonous Fairy Witch. Through his adventures, Liam learns the importance of kindness and perseverence, and discovers that his own life is a story worth telling."
