game (
	name "Manhunter 1: New York"
	description "This science fiction epic is a dark vision of our planet's future. Manhunter evolves around the life of a detective in New York City two years after alien invasion and consequent world takeover. The 'hero' of the story is contracted by the newly founded alien hunter. His goal is to track down and destroy a ring of human saboteurs and militants out to end the alien rule. In the end, will you be on the side of evil, or good? You decide."
