	description "What happens when we work to a degree so that the roles we have at work and at home melts together, and what happens on top of that if our cognitive labor continues in the spirit of capitalism and anti-depressives? This is a game about a man who seems to have a great couple of days, and then things get weird. Point and click, no funny-business."
