game (
	name "Putt-Putt Joins the Parade"
	description "What does it take to be in a parade? Hard work, a bright, shiny chassis and a little help from your friends. That's what Putt-Putt discovers as he gears up to join the annual Cartown Pet Parade. Children will be delighted as they meet the local carfolk, explore a toy shop, mosey down the road and more. Along the way, they learn to think ahead, deal with unexpected problems and give others a hand. The road to discovery has never been more fun-or more educational."
	releaseyear "1992"
	releasemonth "1"
	releaseday "1"
