game (
	name "Red Comrades 2: For the Great Justice"
	description "Vasilij Ivanovich Chapaev, a.k.a. VICH, the hero of Russian civil war of 1918, was kidnapped by evil aliens. Yes, those same aliens who once invaded the earth in the game Petka and VICH Save the Galaxy. Now the aliens want to turn him into a cyborg - a terminator. The hero escapes, but his body already contains cyborg parts, and he has to find his true self - in Russia and abroad, in the present and in the future..."
