game (
	name "Red Comrades Save the Galaxy"
	description "Once upon a time in a galaxy far far away, an alien colony ship suffered an accident. As a result, the Earth got a new satellite in orbit, which in time came to be known as 'The Moon'. Some years later, in the beginning of the civil war in Russia, the shot from the Aurora (the massive cannon which was used to signal the beginning of the war in 1917) somehow reached this moon and triggered the hibernation systems. The aliens wake up. The aliens are pissed."
