game (
	name "Reversion: Chapter 2 - The Meeting"
	description "The Meeting is the second chapter in the Reversion 2D point-and-click adventure game series. In the first episode Christian Milstein escaped the hospital with Victoria Tesla where he woke up with no recollection of the past 20 years. He is now on the streets and the only clue of his past is a man in a piece of a photo he was carrying. In this episode he gets to explore new parts of Buenos Aires and meets friends that form a resistance against the paramilitary organization that has taken over the city."
	releaseyear "2013"
