game (
	name "Shardlight"
	description "Shardlight is a point-and-click adventure game with a post-apocalyptic theme, set in future Australia twenty years after a nuclear war. Ordinary people live in extreme poverty, suffer from disease and strive to have a chance at getting the vaccine. The society is ruled by the Aristocracy - mysterious masked people who are only known under their pseudonyms taken from history."
