game (
	name "Space Quest X: The Lost Chapter"
	description "This previously unknown sequel in the Space Quest Saga begins with Roger Wilco, our beloved hero, still floating in space after defeating Vohaul in SQ2. After who knows how long drifting in space, Roger's escape vessel is trapped by an unknown planet's gravitational pull and crash lands on the planet. The crash triggers the release of the sleep chamber that Roger is snoozing away in. He soon wakes to find himself still inside the escape pod, and also quite blonde!"
