game (
	name "Space Quest: Vohaul Strikes Back"
	description "Sludge Vohaul, Roger's nemesis from some of the previous 'Space Quest' games, has returned: after his death, his mind was installed in a robot body. Roger must face him once more and foil his evil scheme. As he lands on the icy planet of Radon, his ship is damaged and his fiancee Beatrice Wankmeister is kidnapped by Vohaul's goons. He must help the planet's natives, the Furkunz, overthrow Vohaul's Apemen, infiltrate Vohaul's fortress and, finally, enter his mind to discover past events which made Vohaul into a madman and, perhaps, even change the past..."
	releaseyear "2011"
