game (
	name "The Griffon Legend"
	description "The Griffon Legend is a freeware Zelda-like action-adventure created in FreeBASIC as part of a contest won by Daniel Kennedy, known online as Syn9. The game takes place 500 years after the Griffon-Dragon war and now the dragons have returned to reclaim their empire. Cities are falling, people are dying and the lone Griffon Knight Fayne is caught up in the middle of it all."
