game (
	name "The Kite"
	description "The Kite is a 2D point-and-click adventure game about domestic abuse. It tells the story of the Russian couple Masha and Oleh who live in a humble apartment. Oleh has trouble at work and turns to liquor and beating his wife when he gets home. Masha tries to be supportive and wants to turn the situation around, but she does not know what to do. She can hardly provide any food for their young boy, Andrew. Players control Masha mostly after a fight between the couple. Andrew does not want to hear his parents fight and flees to the roof to fly his kite. Afterwards, he disappears and Masha tries to find back her son while Oleh is glued to the television."
	releaseyear "2012"
	releasemonth "1"
