game (
	name "Zork II: The Wizard of Frobozz"
	description "The Wizard appears, floating nonchalantly in the air beside you. He grins sideways at you. The Wizard incants 'Fantasize,' but nothing happens. He shakes the wand. Nothing happens. With a slightly embarassed glance in your direction, he vanishes."
